      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    price_changes = [2.5, -1.3, 2.8, 3.1, -0.5, -2.2, 1.0,\n                     1.5, 1.7, -1.8, 2.9, -0.4, -0.9, 0.8]\n    period = 14\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    gains = [max(change, 0) for change in price_changes[:period]]\n    losses = [abs(min(change, 0)) for change in price_changes[:period]]\n\n    avg_gain = sum(gains) / period\n    avg_loss = sum(losses) / period\n\n    if avg_loss == 0:\n        answer = 100.0\n    else:\n        relative_strength = avg_gain / avg_loss\n        answer = 100 - (100 / (1 + relative_strength))\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(answer, 2)\n```",
